  "description": "An all-new urban boost, the 257 AL AMP electric assisted bike is your amplified partner in crime for daily rides. Designed with clean aesthetics, precise attention to detail, and smart integration, the 257 AL AMP ONE features a lightweight premium aluminium frame with a durable, powder-coated finish built to withstand the rigors of urban life.\nThe naturally powerful and intuitive Bosch Performance CX Smart System motor, combined with a long-lasting 625 Wh battery, delivers smooth, responsive acceleration and extended range - perfect for commuting, grabbing a coffee, or cruising around town at your own pace.\nA low-maintenance Gates Carbon Drive belt system replaces the traditional chain, offering a silent, grease-free ride with exceptional durability and reliability, even in challenging conditions.\nComfort is enhanced by the ICS MTT suspension stem, absorbing road vibrations to ensure a smoother ride. Integrated premium lights provide enhanced visibility and safety, day or night, making the 257 AL AMP ONE the ideal choice for modern urban mobility.",
